## 6. Dependency Storage: unified_relationships Table

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Schema"
        S1[symbol_id<br/>source]
        S2[target<br/>destination]
        S3[type<br/>relationship type]
        S4[confidence<br/>0.0-1.0 score]
        S5[evidence<br/>JSON metadata]
    end

    subgraph "4 Types Currently Stored"
        T1[code-dependency<br/>type: import]
        T2[io-dependency<br/>type: io-dependency<br/>confidence: 0.5-1.0]
        T3[inheritance<br/>type: inheritance]
        T4[calls<br/>type: calls]
    end

    subgraph "Query Patterns"
        Q1[Forward: symbol_id = ?<br/>이 심볼이 사용하는 것]
        Q2[Reverse: target = ?<br/>이 심볼을 사용하는 것]
        Q3[Type Filter: type = ?<br/>특정 관계만]
        Q4[Confidence: confidence ≥ ?<br/>신뢰도 필터]
    end

    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 -->|store| T1
    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 -->|store| T2
    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 -->|store| T3
    S1 & S2 & S3 & S4 & S5 -->|store| T4

    T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 -->|query| Q1
    T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 -->|query| Q2
    T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 -->|query| Q3
    T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 -->|query| Q4

    classDef schema fill:#e1bee7,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef type fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef query fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px

    class S1,S2,S3,S4,S5 schema
    class T1,T2,T3,T4 type
    class Q1,Q2,Q3,Q4 query
```

**설계 원칙**: 단일 테이블에 모든 관계 저장 → 범용 쿼리 가능.

